# The Solar2D SDK used to be vendored here (extracted/, ~692 MB) and was
# purged from the repo's history. Install Solar2D from https://solar2d.com
# instead; if you unpack it inside the project again, this keeps it out of
# the repo. See the build command at the top of README.md.
extracted/

# Build artefacts. Produced by CoronaBuilder from mainGame/, so they are
# reproducible rather than source.
build_output/

# Web bundles zipped up for itch.io uploads.
*.zip

# NOTE: build_output/ and the *.zip bundles were committed before this file
# existed, so they are still tracked and these two rules do nothing for them
# -- .gitignore only applies to untracked paths. To actually drop them:
#   git rm -r --cached build_output *.zip
# That stops tracking them going forward but leaves them in past commits (a
# second history rewrite would be needed to reclaim that space).
